  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "The four Standard Universe levels use direct public per-level values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Effect Hit Rate and Effect Resistance enter the shared battle stat resolver from the reviewed per-level enemy rows and are inherited by linked branches.",
    "Hardy Leaf Sheath combines exact +200% base DEF with one target-turn Toughness-reduction protection through generic effect runtime metadata.",
    "Outrage replaces the controlled unit's ordinary turn with its own Basic ATK against one uniformly selected living friendly unit.",
    "Vigor Overflow adds one exact +15% damage stack after Renewal, Hardy Leaf Sheath, or Engender grants the Deer a buff and mirrors that stack to the currently linked branches.",
    "Maple branches apply Engender and own a damage-triggered 150% ATK counter that applies Shock to the original attacker.",
    "Phase three grants two ordered extra turns through shared Rule IR; Flamboyant Gore counts every existing branch and despawns only Lavish Fruit branches.",
    "The executable AI, three phase transitions, summons, direct attacks, DoTs, healing, Renewal, branch buffs, counters, control, Gore scaling, and branch cleanup are authored without a native handler."
  ]
